riod 1983--2006\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Each case was weighted based on the inverse probability of the hospital being selected, and the weights were summed to produce national estimates\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"95% confidence intervals were calculated using statistical software that accounted for the sample weights and complex sampling design\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"If the sample count was <20 or the coefficient of variation was >30%, the estimate was unstable and not reported.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Rates by incident location and race/ethnicity are not reported because of the high percentage of patients with unknown race/ethnicity.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}